        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polypropylene, granulate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polypropylene, granulate, at plant
A methane emissions update has been incorporated into the LCI of datasets downloaded from the PlasticsEurope website. UUID=09cda8b1-b652-39b2-8761-c93aecc29f70
The polymer  process, upstream processes like propylene production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.
Location: EU27 including Norway and Switzerland
Technology: The polymer process, upstream processes like propylene production, electricity, and steam production as well as transportation of feedstock and waste treatment.

Time period: time to which data mainly refer: 2011 with the methane emission updates in 2023
Production volume: referring to covered PP production (76.7% of 10.972 kt in 2011)
Sampling: Questionnaires sent out to all production units in Europe operated by PlasticEurope member companies.
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_09cda8b1-b652-39b2-8761-c93aecc29f70.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
